 Money is `Decimal` dollars, rounded to cents half-up (`shop/money.py`).
 Shipping is a flat $7.95, free once the merchandise subtotal reaches $75.
 Sales tax is 8.25% of merchandise only; shipping is not taxed.
+
+Discount codes (case-insensitive, surrounding whitespace ignored): `SAVE10` takes
+10% off the merchandise subtotal (rounded half-up to cents), and `FIVEOFF`
+takes $5.00 off, never more than the subtotal. Only one code applies at a time;
+applying a new code replaces the old one. Tax is charged on the discounted
+subtotal. The free-shipping threshold is checked against the subtotal before
+the discount, so a $75.00 cart with `FIVEOFF` still ships free.
